run bodyByteValueI64Call
bind bodyByteValueI64 CSignedInt64 bodyByteValueI64Call

call bodyIsQuoteCall math.equalI64
arg bodyIsQuoteCall left bodyByteValueI64
arg bodyIsQuoteCall right doubleQuoteByteValue
