arg probeIsUserOpCall declarationVerbLength operationDeclVerbLength
run probeIsUserOpCall
bindOk probeIsUserOp Bool probeIsUserOpCall
branchIf probeIsUserOp emitUserOpCallRun
branch runUnhandled

label emitUserOpCallRun
